      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The feeling of being trapped in a relentless, spiraling loop is incredibly draining, and it's natural to feel hopeless when the future seems permanently closed off. When the weight is too much to carry, sometimes the most immediate focus needs to shift from fixing the big problems to simply finding a way to ease the pressure right now. If you can, consider reaching out to a professional who can help you navigate this intense mental exhaustion and the weight of these overwhelming circumstances.",
